{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108307","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108307/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108307/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108307/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108307","id":3204695441,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6_A8WR","number":108307,"title":"`Mesh.surface_get_arrays` returns wrong index array when using empty vertex array","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-05T10:07:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T15:16:38Z","closed_at":"2025-07-07T15:14:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4, 4.5\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\n`Mesh.surface_get_arrays` returns wrong index array when using empty vertex array:\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    var array_mesh := ArrayMesh.new()\n    var arrays := []\n    arrays.resize(Mesh.ARRAY_MAX)\n    # arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX] = PackedVector3Array([Vector3(0, 0, 0), Vector3(0, 0, 1), Vector3(0, 0, 2)])\n    arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX] = PackedInt32Array([0, 1, 2])\n    array_mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, arrays, [], {}, Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USES_EMPTY_VERTEX_ARRAY)\n    var res = array_mesh.surface_get_arrays(0)\n    print(res)\n    # result: [0, 0, 1], it's wrong.\n```\n\nWhen writing arrays to surface, index array is always int32 if vertex array is empty:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/53be3b78d1634406f1fb29e3802c608a5f5104a1/servers/rendering_server.cpp#L892-L916\n\nBut when reading surface to arrays, index array is int16:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/53be3b78d1634406f1fb29e3802c608a5f5104a1/servers/rendering_server.cpp#L1681-L1704\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the script:\n\n<details>\n\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    var array_mesh := ArrayMesh.new()\n    var arrays := []\n    arrays.resize(Mesh.ARRAY_MAX)\n    # arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX] = PackedVector3Array([Vector3(0, 0, 0), Vector3(0, 0, 1), Vector3(0, 0, 2)])\n    arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX] = PackedInt32Array([0, 1, 2])\n    array_mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, arrays, [], {}, Mesh.ARRAY_FLAG_USES_EMPTY_VERTEX_ARRAY)\n    var res = array_mesh.surface_get_arrays(0)\n    print(res)\n    # result: [0, 0, 1], it's wrong.\n```\n\n\n</details>\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108307/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}